Z||000000||turbo86se||11-05-2000||12:49 AM||||Hey everyone! Tonight I met Tom Kite! He and his wife came into my work and I got to meet him. He even signed my favorite hat! I took my TPC/MB hat into work tonight b/c I had a feeling I would get one of the Senior's to sign it. Boy, I was right!!<BR>The IR Senior Tour is playing at the TPC three minutes away from my house! I'm off work tomorrow, and ended up getting a corporate pass for tomorrow's final match. Be looking for me on ESPN!   ||||reg||7
Z||000001||My7Fieros||11-05-2000||02:03 AM||||Congrats!...now, um, who's Tom Kites?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cheever2||11-05-2000||02:27 AM||||Hey Dude!  That's awesome!  What, did you like talk to him?  <P>You'll be wearing a hat with PFF written on it, so we will know who you are on TV, right? (Hey, there's an idea... PFF hats... hmmm)<P>So tell these people who Tom Kite is.  Hint: he's a "swinging" dude.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Haze_Performance||11-05-2000||07:49 AM||||<B>FORE!!!!!!!!!!!!!</B><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlogo1_1.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000004||Cheever2||11-05-2000||08:21 PM||||So, Turbo86, give us the follow-up.  How was your day?  I didn't get to watch it on TV.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||turbo86se||11-05-2000||11:20 PM||||wow, I just woke up after a mid-evening nap. LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The last day was awesome. The course was incredible. Attending my first event, I had a blast. I got out in enough time to see Tom Watson on the 16th, 17th and finish up on the 18th to win the tournament. I did manage to watch the threesome of Green, Floyd, and Canizares tee off on the 17th (par 3, 182 yards water in front and right).  Not one made it on the green, two in the water, and one on the fringe beyond the green. Hubert Green did give me a thumbs up as I smiled to him as he approached the tee-box.  <P>This is what's funny, a friend of mine, who's also going to get me a job when I graduate, Officer Costello, was standing behind Tom Watson (winner) as he was signing autographs. My friend saw me and winked as he was trying to get the same thing as I was, an autograph. As he was saying, "I hate to bother you.."  I handed out my TPC/MB hat and Tom Watson signed it!!!  Now I have Tom Kites' and Tom Watson's signature on my hat!!!  He!! Yeah!!!<BR>My same friend who gave me the Pavilion pass (which is why I'm waking up now... free drinks), is going to try to get a four-some out Wednesday, including me. FORE!!!!!  LOL   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000006||Shiner||11-06-2000||03:24 AM||||OH!  He's one of those guys that gets dressed up all silly and hits a little white ball with a crooked stick!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||onfire||11-06-2000||03:37 AM||||We used to "practice" our swing at the warehouse I work at. But we started losing balls. And when people started to find them,we had to stop. Its been about a year since then. We just might have to take it up again. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>"I know a little bit about everything, and alot about nothing"<BR><A HREF="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/on_fire.html" TARGET=_blank>Check out my little waist of banbwidth.</A>||||reg||1
